    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Answers must be contextualised and grounded in cited sources.  3.2 Drafting assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on the provided context, our company Faber IA can propose an architecture for the solution that meets The client technical requirements. our company Faber IA can deploy our company Faber IA Atelier platform, a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform, on OuraneCloud, which is SecNumCloud-qualified and located within the EU. deploy ensures that data is hosted on qualified infrastructure within the EU with no transfer outside the EU. our Atelier platform, a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform can be containerized using Kubernetes, providing high availability during business hours and resilience to seasonal peak loads. our company Faber IA can integrate our Atelier platform, a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform with cabinet vauclair associ's production tools, accounting production software, payroll software, document management GED, and electronic invoicing dematerialisation environment through our company Faber IA API-first approach (REST + webhook). our Atelier platform, a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform will provide an API type interface and can be integrated with user directory SSO using SAML or OIDC. our company Faber IA can ensure encryption for data protection. our Atelier platform, a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform has a median latency of 1.3 seconds and a p95 latency below 2.5 seconds, which is compatible with daily professional use." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, potential technical risks or challenges that need to be addressed include ensuring seamless integration with the client's existing production tools and software, managing potential scalability issues during seasonal peak loads, and maintaining high availability during business hours." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our company Faber IA must ensure that our company Faber IA solution complies with all relevant regulatory requirements, such as GDPR and professional secrecy.  our company Faber IA hosting options, including the Sovereign tier on OuraneCloud, can help mitigate some of potential technical risks or challenges that need to be addressed by providing a secure and reliable infrastructure for the solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nevertheless, careful planning, testing, and monitoring will be necessary to ensure the successful deployment and operation of the proposed architecture for the solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires: compliance with GDPR, professional secrecy and confidentiality, anti-money laundering obligations (LCB-FT), and auditor independence." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must guarantee the reliability and traceability of outputs, provide a complete audit trail and explainability, and respect the separation of duties." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Data must be protected by encryption or pseudonymisation where relevant, and hosted within the EU with no transfer outside the EU." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given these security and compliance requirements, what are the key controls that need to be implemented to ensure The solution meets these security and compliance requirements, and are there any potential compliance risks or challenges that need to be addressed?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on our company context at Faber IA, Faber IA have experience with GDPR delivery, professional secrecy familiarity, and LCB-FT awareness." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Faber IA also understand the importance of auditor independence and separation of duties." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Assistance in drafting client letters and correspondence, mission notes, file memos and syntheses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet these security and compliance requirements, key controls that need to be implemented include data encryption in transit using TLS 1.3 and at rest using AES-256, as well as pseudonymisation where relevant." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Faber IA the EU-based infrastructure for key management ensures secure handling of sensitive information." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Strict partitioning with logical isolation per client and per mission, along with access controls preventing cross-client circulation of data, will help maintain confidentiality." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Faber IA are certified under ISO 27001 for development, delivery, and operations, which includes scope for privacy information management through Faber IA ISO 27701 certification." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Faber IA hosting partner, OuraneCloud, holds the SecNumCloud qualification at the hosting layer, supporting sovereign hosting of confidential data within the EU." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address potential compliance risks or challenges, Faber IA must ensure that Faber IA solution provides a complete audit trail and explainability, which aligns with Faber IA existing capabilities for logging access and system outputs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Faber IA role-based access control (RBAC) and segregation of duties between development and production operations further support the separation of duties principle." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given Our role-based access control (RBAC) and segregation of duties between development and production operations, potential compliance risks or challenges could include ensuring continuous adherence to GDPR and LCB-FT obligations, maintaining the integrity of Faber IA audit trails, and guaranteeing the reliability and traceability of outputs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regular review and updating of Faber IA data protection measures, as well as ongoing training for Faber IA staff on professional secrecy and confidentiality, will be essential in mitigating potential compliance risks or challenges." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, by leveraging Faber IA existing certifications, data protection measures, and experience with regulatory requirements, Faber IA can implement a solution that meets the client's security and compliance obligations while minimizing potential risks and challenges." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution does not autonomously produce binding or signed deliverables; the professional validates.  3.3 Client-file handling support." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires: compliance with regulatory obligations such as GDPR, anti-money laundering rules (LCB-FT), and professional secrecy and confidentiality." ;
